        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ aman ba, Ama Rwot Obaŋa, yin giri ibedo Obaŋa, dok daŋ kop ame ikobo bedo ateni, yin doŋ iciko pi gin aber ri baŋ amironi, ",
          "type": "text",
