        {
          "text": "Aman doŋ tim ber, Ama Rwot Obaŋa imi gum i ot amironi Daudi, me medde bedo atwal i nyimi; pien yin giri doŋ ikobo oko, gum ame yin imio, bino miyo gum bedo i ot amironi Daudi nakanaka.”",
